ChibiLove (ЧибиПара) — Backend Server & Telegram Bot (Mini App)
Features:
- Clean Couples Economy (R4): clothing, accessory, and cosmetic stores strictly removed.
- Hearts Economy:
  • Exactly 200 hearts starting balance automatically granted to every registered / existing couple (free first streak restore).
  • Daily reward: reliable +10 hearts daily claim mechanism with streak protection check (/api/claim-daily).
  • Streak & relationship restoration: dedicated endpoint (/api/restore-streak) costing exactly 200 hearts.
- Account linking via Telegram @username with confirmation requests.
- Stage-based care system (4 stages, no percentages) + 24h Streak ("Огонёк любви 🔥").
- 8 soft pastel backgrounds for couple and individual room views.
"""

